How to run the models:
Bag of Words:
BOW: python main.py --model BOW

Deep Averaging Network
DAN: python main.py --model DAN
or
DAN: python main.py --model DAN --datapath glove.6B.300d-relativized.txt
DAN: python main.py --model DAN --datapath glove.6B.50d-relativized.txt

Deep Averaging Network that uses Randomly Initialized Embeddings
RANDAN: python main.py --model RandomDAN
RANDAN: python main.py --model RandomDAN --datapath glove.6B.300d-relativized.txt
RANDAN: python main.py --model RandomDAN --datapath glove.6B.50d-relativized.txt

Byte Pair Encoding:
BPEDAN: python main.py --model BPEDAN
BPEDAN: python main.py --model BPEDAN --datapath glove.6B.300d-relativized.txt
BPEDAN: python main.py --model BPEDAN --datapath glove.6B.50d-relativized.txt

**for all DAN models I added the option to run it with the data filename as an
additional argument but it defaults to the "glove.6B.300d-relativized.txt" if
nothing is passed in as an argument. However if you choose to pass in a filename
the options are "glove.6B.300d-relativized.txt" and "glove.6B.50d-relativized.txt"

